PractRand (Practically Random), pre-0.95, by Chris Doty-Humphrey.

PractRand is in the public domain, as its project page states:
https://sourceforge.net/projects/pracrand/ ("License: Public Domain").

The files in this directory are the `include/`, `src/` and `tools/`
directories of
https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/pracrand/PractRand-pre0.95.zip,
unmodified. The archive itself contains no license file.
